Another point I forgot to mention in my earlier post:

If you can, gather a stack of daggers. These are useful for throwing
at enemies before they get close. Often killing them at distance.
However, even if not killed, they should be weakened by the time they
get to you. As you enhance your skill in daggers, you can throw more
than one, and inflict more damage. It is a good fighting method for
most classes. And unlike other projectiles....Daggers don't
disappear!!

